{"4268240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravity Strikers", "steam_appid": 4268240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Strikers is a FPS sport game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into the action: a first-person multiplayer sports shooter, where teams compete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in explosive 3v3 matches mixing strategy, speed, grappling and spectacular goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/3de6d14ecee16fb6e12d017ab17f2886.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/3de6d14ecee16fb6e12d017ab17f2886.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/3de6d14ecee16fb6e12d017ab17f2886.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 minutes to win the victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OK! Here we go, focus. speed, you are speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One match, 5 minutes, no half time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are fast... 3 winners, 3 losers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You eat losers for breakfast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re going to enter this stadium, score goals with the team and then we’ll go home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO CHAMPION, THE TEAM IS COUNTING ON YOU!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/7d9550e5166be9bc5e6d9c4f8cb97d9a.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/7d9550e5166be9bc5e6d9c4f8cb97d9a.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/7d9550e5166be9bc5e6d9c4f8cb97d9a.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play intense matches in 3V3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced and dynamic arena sports FPS, You must play with your team for </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >overwhelming victories. Embody an exceptional athlete and take part in 3vs3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >matches in a frenzied stadium. Pass the ball, eliminate the opponents and score the goals </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of victory with your team! Each match will bring a unique and exciting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/c9d6f5da6c1cccf69e1e9cda0523dcf7.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/c9d6f5da6c1cccf69e1e9cda0523dcf7.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/c9d6f5da6c1cccf69e1e9cda0523dcf7.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel the speed like never before with the aerial mobility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely in the air with your grappling hook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, dash, wall jump... master the art of movement thanks to three-dimensional equipment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and impose your style in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/2d0b4f110240c3f3656b8087dd35e900.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/2d0b4f110240c3f3656b8087dd35e900.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/2d0b4f110240c3f3656b8087dd35e900.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a team with or against your friends </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Strikers shines with its online multiplayer PvP gameplay, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >victory relies on teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily join your friends in private rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fouls, no offsides, no quarter, all’s fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t forget to do the pass... It’s a team sport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/6597fb57e23ba66af3fcad4344c81205.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/6597fb57e23ba66af3fcad4344c81205.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/6597fb57e23ba66af3fcad4344c81205.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the arena of Gravity Strikers, </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >face players from all over the world in real-time online multiplayer matches </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and become a true Striker! Impose your style and show them who is the champion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/398b2ff54d10a9a0095bad6596e499d8.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/398b2ff54d10a9a0095bad6596e499d8.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/398b2ff54d10a9a0095bad6596e499d8.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Strikers is a FPS sport game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into the action: a first-person multiplayer sports shooter, where teams compete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in explosive 3v3 matches mixing strategy, speed, grappling and spectacular goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/3de6d14ecee16fb6e12d017ab17f2886.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/3de6d14ecee16fb6e12d017ab17f2886.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/3de6d14ecee16fb6e12d017ab17f2886.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 minutes to win the victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OK! Here we go, focus. speed, you are speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One match, 5 minutes, no half time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are fast... 3 winners, 3 losers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You eat losers for breakfast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re going to enter this stadium, score goals with the team and then we’ll go home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO CHAMPION, THE TEAM IS COUNTING ON YOU!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/7d9550e5166be9bc5e6d9c4f8cb97d9a.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/7d9550e5166be9bc5e6d9c4f8cb97d9a.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/7d9550e5166be9bc5e6d9c4f8cb97d9a.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play intense matches in 3V3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced and dynamic arena sports FPS, You must play with your team for </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >overwhelming victories. Embody an exceptional athlete and take part in 3vs3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >matches in a frenzied stadium. Pass the ball, eliminate the opponents and score the goals </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of victory with your team! Each match will bring a unique and exciting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/c9d6f5da6c1cccf69e1e9cda0523dcf7.p