 the pass... It’s a team sport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/6597fb57e23ba66af3fcad4344c81205.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/6597fb57e23ba66af3fcad4344c81205.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/6597fb57e23ba66af3fcad4344c81205.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the arena of Gravity Strikers, </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >face players from all over the world in real-time online multiplayer matches </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and become a true Striker! Impose your style and show them who is the champion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/398b2ff54d10a9a0095bad6596e499d8.poster.avif?t=1770226169\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/398b2ff54d10a9a0095bad6596e499d8.webm?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268240/extras/398b2ff54d10a9a0095bad6596e499d8.mp4?t=1770226169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Gravity Strikers is a team-based PvP sports game! Build your squad of champions, master aerial movement, combine shots and passes to control the ball, eliminate your rivals, and score together the goals that lead your team to victory!", "supported